                             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;As most real neurons, the model does not have a fixed threshold: Depending on the history of the membrane potential prior to the spike, the threshold potential can be as low as -55 mV or as high as -40mV&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                            </property>
