                                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;The parameter &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; describes the time scale of the recovery variable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;. Smaller values result in slower recovery. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A typical value is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt; = 0.02.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
